---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { resolvePath } from '../lib/paths';
---

<BaseLayout title="Trajectory Copilot" description="Anna Ford-Richards research portfolio on AI-assisted trajectory design and cislunar mission planning.">
  <section class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-orbital">Mission Minded</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-6xl">Trajectory Copilot</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-300">
        I am researching how large language models can work alongside physics-based astrodynamics tools to assist trajectory design and mission planning for future cislunar space operations. This project investigates whether AI systems can act as engineering copilots for spacecraft mission design and trajectory optimization.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-slate-300">
        The site centers on three goals: benchmark LLMs on known astrodynamics problems, validate their outputs in tools like GMAT or Python workflows, and assess whether they can help engineers work faster and with more confidence.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a class="rounded-full bg-orbital px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:opacity-90" href={resolvePath('/project')}>Project</a>
        <a class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-orbital" href={resolvePath('/about')}>About</a>
        <a class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-thruster" href={resolvePath('/dev-log')}>Dev Log</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-orbital">Goal 1</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Benchmark how well LLMs can reproduce and explain known trajectory design problems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-thruster">Goal 2</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Check whether LLM outputs can be validated inside GMAT or Python astrodynamics workflows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-white">Goal 3</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Evaluate whether AI actually helps engineers move faster and with more confidence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
